{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06395","headline":"送刘十 · 李颀","name":"送刘十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十不官亦不娶，时人焉识道高下。\n房中唯有老氏经，枥上空余少游马。\n往来嵩华与函秦，放歌一曲前山春。\n西林独鹤引闲步，南涧飞泉清角巾。\n前年上书不得意，归卧东窓兀然醉。\n诸兄相继掌青史，第五之名齐骠骑。\n烹葵摘果告我行，落日夏云纵复横。\n闻道谢安掩口笑，知君不免爲苍生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}